  "name": "NEPRA uniform residential tariff (A-1, below 5 kW)",
  "effective_from": "2026-02-12",
  "updated_at": "2026-10-22",
  "source_note": "Slab and fixed charges: NEPRA decision TRF-100 (11 Feb 2026) notified as S.R.O. 279(I)/2026, same for all WAPDA DISCOs and K-Electric. FCA and QTA are also applied uniformly to K-Electric (federal policy, 2026); use company_overrides if a company ever differs. FCA and QTA change every month or quarter. Electricity duty and PTV fee were removed from bills in July 2025. TOU (5 kW and above): Rs 46.85 peak / Rs 34.53 off-peak, fixed Rs 675/kW on 50% of sanctioned load (S.R.O. 279(I)/2026). Solar: NEPRA Prosumer Regulations 2026 — new agreements are net billed with exports bought at Rs 8.13/unit; existing net-metering agreements keep Rs 25.32/unit.",
